  "prefLabel": "Rko 216.03 Role of Agency Staff",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rko 216.03 Role of Agency Staff.\n\n(a) Agency staff, if any, shall have no role in hearings unless:\n\n(1) Designated as the presiding officer;\n\n(2) Assigned to render clerical or administrative support in connection with the proceeding; or\n\n(3) Called as a witness.\n\nSource. #13921, eff 5-20-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rko100-200.html"
